OL,3,GNEWSATeacher banned over pen with
OL,4,Ahidden camera
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teacher who gave a pupil a pen with a
OL,7,Fhidden camera and encouraged her to
OL,8,Fchange clothes before using it has been
OL,9,Fbanned indefinitely from the
OL,10,Fprofession.
OL,12,FA Teaching Regulation Agency (TRA)
OL,13,Fpanel found the actions of Matthew
OL,14,FUdall, 33, "were sexually motivated and
OL,15,Fhad the potential to cause serious harm
OL,16,Fto the pupil".
OL,18,FThe former science teacher, who was
OL,19,Fteaching at a Warwickshire school, had
OL,20,Fencouraged the student to change her
OL,21,Fclothes before writing in a journal at
OL,22,Fhome with the pen.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
